<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TELEBRAS LOWERED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TELEBRAS LOWERED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Mickey Schleien downgraded Telebras SA to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- said lowered 1997 earnings per ADR forecast to $9.85 from $10.95 and 1998 view to $12.39 from $11.51 to take into account higher-than-anticipated operating expenses and income tax rates.</p>
<p>-- extended time horizon on $175 price target to 12 months from six months.</p>
<p>-- stock was flat at 137-1/2 in U.S. trading.</p>
</text>
